<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800"><title>Gunakan Variabel dan Simbol Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170654957487">Simbol pengelompokan dalam aljabar mirip dengan koma, titik dua, dan tanda baca lainnya dalam bahasa Indonesia. Simbol-simbol ini memperjelas ekspresi mana yang harus dikelompokkan dan dipisahkan dari ekspresi lain. Sekarang kita akan memperkenalkan tiga jenis.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655219760">
<title>Simbol Pengelompokan</title>
<equation id="fs-id1167269979347" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Tanda kurung biasa</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.15em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow /><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Tanda kurung siku</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.15em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow /><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Tanda kurung kurawal</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mrow><m:mo>{</m:mo><m:mrow /><m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654880176">Berikut beberapa contoh ekspresi yang memuat <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00011">simbol pengelompokan</term>. Nanti dalam subbab ini kita akan menyederhanakan ekspresi seperti ini.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654936322" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mo>{</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1166424830424"><newline /></para>
</section>
